!CHECK 220745.40 | 217766.10 00 | line 7 B,B CCW R -- BCCWR at 217766.00, printed p.157's definition; manual $CCW 2.0.  The name is CCW (channel control word) and not "COW"
!CHECK 220746.00 | 220011.10 00 | line 8 B,W REL -RELEASE -- WREL at 220011.00; manual $REL 2.32
!CHECK 220746.40 | 220021.50 00 | line 9 B,K S LOC -LOCATE  - DISK ONLY -- KSLOC at 220021.40, so 0o50 is bit 32 OR the branch's 0o10; manual $LOC 3.0
!CHECK 220747.00 | 220106.10 00 | line 10 B,W FC -FEED CARD - PUNCH ONLY -- WFC at 220106.00, CONFIRMING the 220106.10 eight landed decks took from the volume OCR of this page; manual $FC 3.32
